@PriceHunt.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5119

### Search all suppliers (Supplier G never responds, so this ends as TimedOut after 6s)
POST {{PriceHunt.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromLocation": "Tel Aviv",
  "toLocation": "London",
  "fromDate": "2026-11-01",
  "toDate": "2026-11-08",
  "selectedSuppliers": []
}

### Search a subset of suppliers (should end as Completed)
POST {{PriceHunt.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromLocation": "Tel Aviv",
  "toLocation": "Paris",
  "fromDate": "2026-12-01",
  "toDate": "2026-12-05",
  "selectedSuppliers": ["Supplier A", "Supplier B", "Supplier F"]
}

### History
GET {{PriceHunt.Api_HostAddress}}/api/history?page=1&pageSize=10

### History filtered
GET {{PriceHunt.Api_HostAddress}}/api/history?status=TimedOut&supplier=Supplier%20G
